# .gitignore file created for free with Tower (https://www.git-tower.com/)
# For suggestions or improvements please contact us using support@git-tower.com
# Generated on 2025-10-11
# Includes: bash

### InSight Dev Bootstrap runtime output ###
# check/install/upgrade write these into the repo root by default
# (base_name "dev_setup_status", format extension csv/json/txt/html/md)
# unless --output-dir is given.
dev_setup_status_*
compliance_report_*.json
security_report_*.json

### Universal ###
# Common files that should be ignored in all projects

# Logs
*.log
# Temporary and Old files
*.tmp
*~
*.old
*.bak

# Environment files (containing secrets, API keys, credentials)
.env
*.env
.env.*

# Local configuration that shouldn't be shared
*.local

### Bash ###
# bash specific files

*.sh~
*.bash_history
